      "side": 1,
      "message": "Superficially, this makes sense to me, but the overall picture of when `PD_DISABLED_NO_CONNECTION` is set is unclear. It looks like we already disable PD it when we enter the Unattached states and during ErrorRecovery (via `restart_tc_sm`), and we enable it when after at Attached state stabilizes. We call `tc_detached` at almost the same times.\n\nWhat does this change do to the timing of the flag change WRT the PE?",
      "revId": "953b22953f522290721310e01cd81ddf9aef824e",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
