      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I have a coherent vision, but I think with the change you already have, you could get rid of the `tc_enable_pd(port, 0)` calls in `tc_unattached_src_entry` and `tc_unattached_snk_entry`, and it would have negligible impact on behavior. (The `CONFIG_USB_PE_SM` guards now seem like they might be extraneous or just to make linking easier. I wouldn\u0027t expect this flag to do anything if we don\u0027t have a PE.)",
